# ── LaTeX build artifacts ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The build compiles out of tree (latexmk -outdir=target/…), so these only ever
# appear when something was compiled in place. Matched at any depth: the old
# `*/*.log` form only reached one level down and missed unitXX/lessonYY/<comp>/.
**/*.aux
**/*.log
**/*.out
**/*.nav
**/*.snm
**/*.toc
**/*.fls
**/*.fdb_latexmk
**/*.xdv
**/*.synctex.gz

# NOTE: *.pdf is deliberately NOT ignored. A prefab component is a real source
# file — <comp>/main.pdf with no main.tex beside it — and shared/lesson.mk feeds
# it straight to pdfunite. Ignoring PDFs would make prefabs uncommittable. A
# stray PDF from an in-place compile shows up as untracked; delete it, don't
# commit it.

# ── Build output ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
build
target
.stamps

# ── Editor / OS / tooling ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.idea
**/.DS_Store
.claude/worktrees
.claire
